{
  "schemaVersion": 2,
  "name": "M Blade",
  "theme": "mblade",
  "_about": "M Blade, after a photo of a BMW M cluster view (Nov 14 2026), generated by tools/gen_mblade_navi.py (edit that and regenerate): a blue card with the M stripes and a dark plate for the gear and the speed, a red rev blade leaning right (0..7000 rpm, the stock-style shift light at the top), and two thin gauge pairs to its right: the hybrid battery (in place of the photo's oil temperature) and the fuel with the range. The battery charge runs along the bottom, clear of BMW's belt light (x 587..626, y 663..700); the oil and outside temperatures are on the right. Waze's map is drawn at the centred 1088x480 of the panel and cannot be moved, so with 'Show Waze map inside the theme' (or Cluster Centre / Cluster Info) the theme is rebuilt as the Sport theme is (backdrop_open and the o_ readouts): the see-through window in the middle (x 534..1386, y 120..600), the blade on the left, a small card with the gear and speed and the gauges on the right, nothing under the map. Clear of the black box BMW draws at x 1406..1597, y 342..419. Widget reference: shared/hud.js header.",
